# Audi A6 C5 four-door saloon, 1997-2004.
#
# The second A6: the rounded, more aerodynamic C5 body with the curved
# roofline, the four-ring grille and the quattro option. The Avant and
# allroad are different bodies and are not represented.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audi_A6
#
# Dimensions 4.796 x 1.810 x 1.453 m, wheelbase 2.760 m.
#
# Shape reference: image 1 is a side-on driving view, not a true level
# profile; the front and rear three-quarters show the lamps and tail. The
# flank is estimated; the limitation is recorded.
#
# Colours: grade (d); no UK chart was established. Black, silver, grey and
# blue are plain names. Weights 20, 18, 17, 15, total 70, provisional.
#
# Speed 225 km/h. Comfort 90/465, on the line 330 + 1.5 x 90. Classes 2,3.
# Dates are road presence: 1997 intro, retires staggered 2022-2025.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/audi-a6-c5.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/audi-a6-c5.dae. References:
# citycars/references/audi-a6-c5/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: image 1 is a motion-blurred driving shot, not a profile;
# the flank is estimated. The roof curve is too flat and the boot slightly long,
# and the headlamps read weakly against a pale body. At 128 px the rounded nose,
# small ringed grille and soft shoulder read as a C5 A6.


obj=citycar
